Grammar

    0 $accept: addition_list $end

    1 addition_list: addition SEMICOLON
    2              | addition_list addition SEMICOLON

    3 addition: NUMBER
    4         | IDENTIFIER
    5         | addition '+' addition
    6         | IDENTIFIER '=' addition


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    '+' (43) 5
    '=' (61) 6
    error (256)
    NUMBER <node> (258) 3
    IDENTIFIER <node> (259) 4 6
    SEMICOLON (260) 1 2


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (8)
        on left: 0
    addition_list <node> (9)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 0 2
    addition <node> (10)
        on left: 3 4 5 6
        on right: 1 2 5 6


State 0

    0 $accept: . addition_list $end

    NUMBER      shift, and go to state 1
    IDENTIFIER  shift, and go to state 2

    addition_list  go to state 3
    addition       go to state 4


State 1

    3 addition: NUMBER .

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (addition)


State 2

    4 addition: IDENTIFIER .
    6         | IDENTIFIER . '=' addition

    '='  shift, and go to state 5

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (addition)


State 3

    0 $accept: addition_list . $end
    2 addition_list: addition_list . addition SEMICOLON

    $end        shift, and go to state 6
    NUMBER      shift, and go to state 1
    IDENTIFIER  shift, and go to state 2

    addition  go to state 7


State 4

    1 addition_list: addition . SEMICOLON
    5 addition: addition . '+' addition

    SEMICOLON  shift, and go to state 8
    '+'        shift, and go to state 9


State 5

    6 addition: IDENTIFIER '=' . addition

    NUMBER      shift, and go to state 1
    IDENTIFIER  shift, and go to state 2

    addition  go to state 10


State 6

    0 $accept: addition_list $end .

    $default  accept


State 7

    2 addition_list: addition_list addition . SEMICOLON
    5 addition: addition . '+' addition

    SEMICOLON  shift, and go to state 11
    '+'        shift, and go to state 9


State 8

    1 addition_list: addition SEMICOLON .

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (addition_list)


State 9

    5 addition: addition '+' . addition

    NUMBER      shift, and go to state 1
    IDENTIFIER  shift, and go to state 2

    addition  go to state 12


State 10

    5 addition: addition . '+' addition
    6         | IDENTIFIER '=' addition .

    '+'  shift, and go to state 9

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (addition)


State 11

    2 addition_list: addition_list addition SEMICOLON .

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (addition_list)


State 12

    5 addition: addition . '+' addition
    5         | addition '+' addition .

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (addition)
